      "question": "If f(x) = x², what is the equation of the function after translating 2 units left and 3 units up?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "f(x) = (x + 2)² - 3",
        "B": "f(x) = (x - 2)² + 3",
        "C": "f(x) = (x + 2)² + 3",
        "D": "f(x) = (x - 2)² - 3",
        "E": "f(x) = x² + 2 + 3"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Translate 2 units left: replace x with (x + 2). Translate 3 units up: add 3. Result: f(x) = (x + 2)² + 3.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Original: f(x) = x².",
        "2. Left 2: replace x with (x + 2) → (x + 2)².",
        "3. Up 3: add 3 → (x + 2)² + 3."
      ],
      "fastStrategy": "Horizontal shift left h: (x + h); vertical shift up k: + k."
